  "title": "Mom&#39;s Pumpkin Pie",
  "description": "Pumpkin puree is blended with white and brown sugars, milk, cream, and pinches of cinnamon, nutmeg, ginger, and cloves. Altogether, they make a rich and sensational pumpkin pie filling that bakes up perfectly for the holidays.",
